{"id":"fcfe6f023ac58abf","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-strong-kleene.md","title":"强 Kleene 三值运算","display":"df-strong-kleene — 强 Kleene 三值运算","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-strong-kleene","aliases":["91-df-strong-kleene","91-df-SK-logic"],"display":"df-strong-kleene — 强 Kleene 三值运算","depends_on":["[[91-df-language-with-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-strong-kleene"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-strong-kleene</span><span>91-df-SK-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-strong-kleene — 强 Kleene 三值运算"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SK}_3\">\\(\\mathrm{SK}_3\\)</span> 为下述评估性质；下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SK}\">\\(\\mathrm{SK}\\)</span> 表示强 Kleene 运算。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf3=\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u,\\mathbf t\\}\">\\(\\mathbf3=\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u,\\mathbf t\\}\\)</span>，真值序为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf f&lt;_t\\mathbf u&lt;_t\\mathbf t\">\\(\\mathbf f&lt;_t\\mathbf u&lt;_t\\mathbf t\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf3\">\\(v:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf3\\)</span> 为候选句子评估，量词论域为标准 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strong\\text{-}kleene}\\vdash\\quad\n\n\\neg_{\\rm SK}\\mathbf t=\\mathbf f,\\quad\\neg_{\\rm SK}\\mathbf f=\\mathbf t,\\quad\\neg_{\\rm SK}\\mathbf u=\\mathbf u,\n\\qquad a\\land_{\\rm SK}b=\\min_{&lt;_t}(a,b),\\quad a\\lor_{\\rm SK}b=\\max_{&lt;_t}(a,b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strong\\text{-}kleene}\\vdash\\quad\n\n\\neg_{\\rm SK}\\mathbf t=\\mathbf f,\\quad\\neg_{\\rm SK}\\mathbf f=\\mathbf t,\\quad\\neg_{\\rm SK}\\mathbf u=\\mathbf u,\n\\qquad a\\land_{\\rm SK}b=\\min_{&lt;_t}(a,b),\\quad a\\lor_{\\rm SK}b=\\max_{&lt;_t}(a,b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SK}_3(v)\">\\(\\mathrm{SK}_3(v)\\)</span> 表示对所有句子、以及至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 自由的公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(x)\">\\(\\theta(x)\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nv(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;=\\neg_{\\rm SK}v(\\varphi),&amp;v(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;=v(\\varphi)\\land_{\\rm SK}v(\\psi),\\\\\nv(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)&amp;=v(\\varphi)\\lor_{\\rm SK}v(\\psi),&amp;\nv(\\forall x\\theta)&amp;=\\inf_{&lt;_t}\\{v(\\theta(\\overline n)):n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\nv(\\exists x\\theta)&amp;=\\sup_{&lt;_t}\\{v(\\theta(\\overline n)):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}.&amp;&amp;\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nv(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;=\\neg_{\\rm SK}v(\\varphi),&amp;v(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;=v(\\varphi)\\land_{\\rm SK}v(\\psi),\\\\\nv(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)&amp;=v(\\varphi)\\lor_{\\rm SK}v(\\psi),&amp;\nv(\\forall x\\theta)&amp;=\\inf_{&lt;_t}\\{v(\\theta(\\overline n)):n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\nv(\\exists x\\theta)&amp;=\\sup_{&lt;_t}\\{v(\\theta(\\overline n)):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}.&amp;&amp;\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>例如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf f\\land\\mathbf u=\\mathbf f\">\\(\\mathbf f\\land\\mathbf u=\\mathbf f\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf t\\lor\\mathbf u=\\mathbf t\">\\(\\mathbf t\\lor\\mathbf u=\\mathbf t\\)</span>。量词实例集非空，故三元链的上下确界存在。\n信息序为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf u\\sqsubseteq\\mathbf t\">\\(\\mathbf u\\sqsubseteq\\mathbf t\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf u\\sqsubseteq\\mathbf f\">\\(\\mathbf u\\sqsubseteq\\mathbf f\\)</span>，而真与假互不比较；它不同于用于计算联结词的真值序。\n原书还使用允许过剩的推广评估；本节点只定义一致三值部分，不能将其值域假装成完整固定点格。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 15.9–15.11、Lemma 15.12，印刷页 191–194，PDF 页 202–205。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{SK}_3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SK}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf3=\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u,\\mathbf t\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf f<_t\\mathbf u<_t\\mathbf t","display":false},{"tex":"v:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strong\\text{-}kleene}\\vdash\\quad\n\n\\neg_{\\rm SK}\\mathbf t=\\mathbf f,\\quad\\neg_{\\rm SK}\\mathbf f=\\mathbf t,\\quad\\neg_{\\rm SK}\\mathbf u=\\mathbf u,\n\\qquad a\\land_{\\rm SK}b=\\min_{<_t}(a,b),\\quad a\\lor_{\\rm SK}b=\\max_{<_t}(a,b).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SK}_3(v)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nv(\\neg\\varphi)&=\\neg_{\\rm SK}v(\\varphi),&v(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&=v(\\varphi)\\land_{\\rm SK}v(\\psi),\\\\\nv(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)&=v(\\varphi)\\lor_{\\rm SK}v(\\psi),&\nv(\\forall x\\theta)&=\\inf_{<_t}\\{v(\\theta(\\overline n)):n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\nv(\\exists x\\theta)&=\\sup_{<_t}\\{v(\\theta(\\overline n)):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}.&&\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf f\\land\\mathbf u=\\mathbf f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf t\\lor\\mathbf u=\\mathbf t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf u\\sqsubseteq\\mathbf t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf u\\sqsubseteq\\mathbf f","display":false}],"bytes":1890,"backlinks":[{"id":"0d412b656b2bbda0","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2a6ae68f45ba9960","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"令 $\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3$ 为满足 [[91-df-strong-kleene]] 全部递归子句和以下原子条件的评估："},{"id":"bf50594cf0328bc9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf 3=\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u,\\mathbf t\\}$、$<_{t}$ 与\n$\\neg_{\\mathrm{SK}}$ (三值集、真值序和强 Kleene 否定,\nsee [[91-df-strong-kleene]])"},{"id":"b0e2f74fa0a4326a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-strong-kleene]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-strong-kleene]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-84","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conj